      "message": "I was waiting to get your feedback on this approach. I had intended this to be used as a means to test for relevant parts of the Enter_USB data object contents. My thought was that the test setup could set the field(s) that needed to be checked against. If the field was left as 0, then it would be a don\u0027t care. Extending this idea, for now, I was just using it as a simply binary with 0 (default) meaning accept, and non-zero triggers a reject.\n\nBut, I since realized that the message checking could be done in the test source file via the PD message log and parsing the message contents from there. In that case, we\u0027d still want some bool here to control ACCEPT/REJECT from the partner port.",
