      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean that our TCPM won\u0027t enter USB4 with a cable that doesn\u0027t support any alt modes? My bad. We should fix that.",
      "revId": "b9bb3284e073585d1ce07d994259c98f0d14da55",
